### Feature ProductType — GET ALL / GET ONE
### JWT + RBAC (desde el ISS-13): requiere el token de un usuario con la concesión
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### GET ALL — solo tipos activos
# @name getAllProductTypes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ONE — 404 si no existe o está inactivo
# @name getOneProductType
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 400 — :id no numérico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
